# Pairs with PeerAuthorityBounded. The remote-coordinator condition is dropped, so
# this cluster's own saga runs under system origin instead of the operator's identity.
MODULE: PeerRestoreElevatesOwnCoordinator
TARGET: PeerAuthorityBounded
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a step this cluster's own coordinator delivers runs with peer authority

--- FIND
HasPeerAuthority(c) == wired /\ c \notin {Self, NoCluster} /\ c \in topology
--- REPLACE
HasPeerAuthority(c) == wired /\ c # NoCluster /\ (c = Self \/ c \in topology)
--- END
